<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Commonwealth of vivi -->
  <VV_ViviFederation.label>薇薇聯邦</VV_ViviFederation.label>
  <!-- EN: Federation established by independent Vivi nests for their common interest. There was once a unified Vivi Empire, but due to the influx and attack of outsiders, it is currently divided into individual, independent nests.\nOnly a few traces of the former empire remain, in the form of certain traditions and administrative structures. They are uninterested in anything beyond their own activities, rarely initiate attacks, but are aggressive to those who pose a threat and defend themselves with their unique peculiar technology. -->
  <VV_ViviFederation.description>由獨立的薇薇蜂巢為共同利益而建立的聯盟。曾經存在一個統一的薇薇帝國，但由于外來者的涌入與攻擊，它們目前被劃分為相互獨立的蜂巢。\n聯邦有少數前帝國以傳統和行政結構的形式存在的遺痕。他們對自己活動之外的任何事情都不感興趣，很少發起攻擊，但對那些構成威脅的人很有攻擊性，聯邦使用他們獨特的技術自衛。</VV_ViviFederation.description>
  <!-- EN: federation representative -->
  <VV_ViviFederation.leaderTitle>女皇</VV_ViviFederation.leaderTitle>
  <!-- EN: {0} from {1} are attacking your {2}. -->
  <VV_ViviFederation.messageDefendersAttacking>來自{1}的{0}正在攻擊你的{2}</VV_ViviFederation.messageDefendersAttacking>
